      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Wax Transcription Standard\n\nAll edges are stock MAIN. Output 0 'continue' only orders: Stamp \u2192 Clipboard \u2192 Classify.\n\nOutput 1 'requires' gates: Title is wired from Classify's requires port, so a failed Classify leaves Title dependency-blocked instead of dropped.\n\nClassify \u2192 Diarize is a continue edge (ordering only): Diarize skips a transcript classified as a monolog (its registry `when`), and still runs when Classify fails, since the field is then absent. Wax owns execution: `wax pipeline import` compiles this graph into the frozen plan authority; n8n never schedules it.",
